**Engineering Product Quality Expert (f/m/div.) – Any Bosch Portugal Site**


* Full-time
* Legal Entity: Robert Bosch


**Company Description**

The Bosch Group has more than 400 000 employees around the world, present in 60 countries, and we are proud to impact people’s lives and to work towards a more sustainable future. 


In the city of Aveiro, Bosch has one of its biggest production sites for Bosch Home Comfort division, as well as a Research and Development Center for new and improved heating solutions for the residential segment. Within Bosch Aveiro's office we have part of the corporate quality team working in quality processes for all Bosch divisions worldwide.


At Bosch, we shape the future by inventing high-quality technologies and services that spark enthusiasm and enrich people’s lives. Our promise to our associates is rock-solid: we grow together, we enjoy our work, and we inspire each other. Join in and feel the difference in mindsets, cultures, generations, identities and perspectives. Everyone should bring their authenticity and work together respectfully. By including everyone and ensuring equal opportunities we unleash our full potential. 


**Job Description**

**Your contribution to something big:**

Within the Bosch Group, our Corporate Quality department, responsible for Bosch quality management tools and processes worldwide, is expanding its global team in Portugal. As the setting owner and head of all Engineering Product Quality experts, you will lead a community of Engineering Product Quality leaders and experts to drive and leverage quality in engineering through the EPQ role. For that you will:

* Shape and maintain a network of engineering product quality leaders and experts from the Bosch group to define and ensure up to date governance principles and directives;
* Collect and share good practices within the different Bosch divisions;
* Develop and maintain the enabling concept, including train the trainer, as well as plan and monitor training execution and trainer qualification;
* Establish and implement, together with the engineering product quality experts’ network, methods and tools within the product development process to ensure that risks and opportunities are being openly addressed, and decisions are well-founded and retraceable;
* Align the EPQ role with other, adjacent systems, roles and tasks (e.g., BES, BPS, UX, PM, SW-Quality) and expand the EPQ role’s focus to the complete product lifecycle;
* Drive quality improvement initiatives to leverage the engineering product quality role with the support and framework from the Corporate Quality Management department.


**Qualifications**

**What distinguishes you:** 

* **Education:** Degree in Mechanical, Physics, Electrical or Software Engineering or equivalent;
* **Experience and know how:** 
+ Solid basis of technical knowledge in product engineering;
+ Enthusiasm in understanding technical contents;
+ Experience in product and/or SW development;;
+ Knowledge of quality methods, processes & tools (problem solving, 8D Report, management of characteristics and others);
+ Knowledge of engineering methods, processes & tools (DRBFM, FMEA, FTA, DfR, FAM, ASPICE and others);
* **Working Style and Methods:** Analytical, detail oriented and structured work style with a problem-solving mindset. Ability to work within a team environment and to create a good network inside and outside the company;

**Personality:** proactive and autonomous, with an assertive communication style. Interested in continuous development and working in an international set up, with ability to adapt and influence;

* **Languages:** very good knowledge and communication in English. Knowledge of German is a plus.


**Additional Information**

**Work #LikeABosch includes:**   

Flexible work conditions | Hybrid work system | Exchange with colleagues around the world | Health insurance and medical office on site (general surgeon, psychology, physiotherapy, general clinic) | Training opportunities (p.e., technical training, foreign languages training) & certifications | Access to great discounts in partnerships and Bosch products | Sports and health related activities | Free parking lot | Canteen


**Success stories don´t just happen. They are made...**

**Make it happen! We are looking forward to your application!**


