**Your Role as an** Online Content Marketer

We are constantly looking for creative and innovative solutions to be closer to the user: creating content that captivates and binds! To realize this objective, we are looking for an Online Content Marketeer. Your challenge is to generate the right content and use it as optimally as possible via various online channels (websites, social media, E-dealers).

As a Content Marketeer you are brimming with energy and inspiring ideas. You are creative and have an eye for design. You don't miss details. You are able to work in a rapidly changing and dynamic environment and you are proactive and independent.

