Contentful is deeply curious about our Customer’s pain points and goals. As a Working Student in UX Research (f/m/d), you will be working closely with the Research team, gaining experience in collaborating in a fast paced and agile environment.

* Craft robust insights by fetching and analyzing information from different sources;
