**Job Description**

**Your contribution to something big:**

* Be part of the team and support us in validation and verification of hydraulic and electronic system solutions and architectures for hybrid heat pumps (a combination of heat pump and boiler);
* You perform tests on different system levels using different test approaches (e.g. Model in the Loop (MiL), Hardware in the Loop (HiL), wet testing directly at the test bench) and state of the art equipment and tools;
* You tune and verify system control strategies on the system test bench;
* Additionally, you define and execute model-based function tests of existing and newly developed control strategies;
* Finally, you support the consistency of selected hybrid control strategies among various electronic platforms.


