+ Profound knowledge in testing of HVAC systems, experience with heat pumps is a plus;
+ Ideally you have gained relevant professional experience in model-based system engineering/virtual testing with MATLAB/Simulink applying MiL/HiL;
+ Competent handling of requirements and test management tools (e.g. Jira, Xray);
* **Enthusiasm:** 
+ Willingness to travel abroad;
* **Languages**: Fluency in English.


