- Confirmation of recurrent proceedings;  
- Responsibility for immediate mechanical analysis associated with quality problems;  
- Control and validation of theoretical and practical product and process training for all employees;  
- Support in the production planning of intermediate processes (bonding, manual assembly, ...);  
- Active participation in Problem Solving (quality, safety, OEE, ...);  
- Participation in the definition of new standards;  
- Production re-planning in conjunction with logistics;  
- Responsibility for the analysis and approval of production batches (ALR)**.**


