- Bachelor's degree in Industrial Engineering or similiar;  
- Good command of English;  
- Good communication skills;  
- Goal and customer oriented;  
- Training, integration of new line managers;  
- Priority setting for support teams;  
- Manage conflicts;  
- Promote motivation, cooperation and team spirit;  
- Lead and promote continuous improvement.


