At Bosch, we shape the future by inventing high-quality technologies and services that spark enthusiasm and enrich people’s lives. Our promise to our associates is rock-solid: we grow together, we enjoy our work, and we inspire each other. Join in and feel the difference in mindsets, cultures, generations, identities and perspectives. Everyone should bring their authenticity and work together respectfully. By including everyone and ensuring equal opportunities we unleash our full potential. 


**Job Description**

**Your contribution to something big:**

As a Mechanical Design Engineer, you will be an integral part of our team, contributing to the development and improvement of our tools, systems, and automated machines for our production lines. Your expertise in mechanical design and attention to detail will play a vital role in shaping the success of our projects. Here's what you can expect from your role:

* Responsible for creating 3D mechanical designs and develop detailed part lists of new tools and machines for final assembly lines;
* Ensure that the designs meet the required specifications. You will collaborate with cross-functional teams to gather input and incorporate their requirements into the design process;
* Responsible to manage and maintain the Product Data Management system.
* Perform acceptance evaluations at suppliers facilities during the equipment construction;
* Assure milestone for the industrialization phase with the availability of equipment.


