* Strong knowledge of mechanical engineering principles, manufacturing processes, and industry standards;
* Excellent problem-solving and analytical skills;
* Effective communication and collaboration abilities;
* Detail-oriented mindset with a focus on accuracy and quality;
* Familiarity with regulatory requirements and safety guidelines in mechanical design;
* You must be a self-motivated, flexible, goal-oriented person with innovation culture;
* Independent working attitude with ability to work inside teams/areas;
* Good English language and presentation skills;
* Availability to travel.

We look forward to welcoming a talented and dedicated Mechanical Design Engineer like you to our team. Your contributions will be instrumental in driving the success of our projects and achieving our goals.


