Flexible work conditions | Hybrid work system | Exchange with colleagues around the world | Health insurance and medical office on site (psychology, general clinic) | Training opportunities (p.e., technical training, foreign languages training) & certifications | Access to great discounts in partnerships and Bosch products | Sports and health related activities | Great access to public transports | Free transport from Porto | Free parking lot | Canteen 


