* University degree in Business Informatics or any comparable technical background;
* Experience with SAP systems is a plus;
* Global disposition, team focus and strong (intercultural) communication skills to be effective in international virtual teams;
* Logical, structured, proactive approach to IT solutions;
* Flexibility and resiliency to adapt to a growing and fast-changing work environment;
* Proficiency in using MS office tools;
* Fluent English, both written and spoken (C1 level).


