**Company Description**

The Bosch Group has more than 400 000 employees around the world, present in 60 countries, and we are proud to impact people’s lives and to work towards a more sustainable future.   
In the city of Aveiro, Bosch has one of its biggest production sites for Bosch Home Comfort division, as well as a Research and Development Center for new and improved heating solutions for the residential segment. With more than 1400 employees, focused on innovation, sustainability and collaboration, Bosch Aveiro joins together experts in diverse areas, from mechanical engineering to connectivity and software solutions, as well as industrialization and quality.   
At Bosch, we shape the future by inventing high-quality technologies and services that spark enthusiasm and enrich people’s lives. Our promise to our associates is rock-solid: we grow together, we enjoy our work, and we inspire each other. Join in and feel the difference in mindsets, cultures, generations, identities and perspectives. Everyone should bring their authenticity and work together respectfully. By including everyone and ensuring equal opportunities we unleash our full potential. 


**Job Description**

**Your contribution to something big:**

Integration into the company's digitalization and Industry 4.0 team, with a strong focus on innovation, developing projects in broad areas such as:

* Digitalization of manufacturing equipment and connection to MES (Manufacturing Execution System) and ERP (Enterprise Resource Planning) systems;
* Management of information systems (servers, databases, and software applications);
* Development of software solutions (backend + frontend);
* Process improvement with the implementation of innovative systems and technologies, such as: IoT | Augmented Reality | Robotics | Data analytics, artificial intelligence, machine learning, and/or big data to capitalize on the collected data. 

As a developer on our team, you will work in a constantly evolving environment due to technological advances and our organization's innovation strategy. You will need to create, maintain, and improve systems to meet the specific needs of our employees/clients, with whom you will have direct contact. To achieve this, you should be able to create and analyze requirements, develop and create technical specifications, and implement software solutions. You should also be able to identify and integrate improvements into existing systems.

You will be exposed to a variety of different technologies and develop software with a direct impact on the industry. One of our missions is to explore new technologies that can positively influence the improvement of the production processes at our factory in Aveiro.

For this position, we are looking for a profile with potential, who can integrate into the ongoing projects, standing out for teamwork and contributing to a healthy professional development environment.


**Qualifications**

**What distinguishes you:** 

* Bachelor's and/or Master's degree in Computer Science / SW Engineering, Electrical and Computer Engineering, Mechanical Engineering, or similar;
* Computer skills (preferred but not mandatory):
+ Programming in .NET / C#;
+ Web Development (preferably Angular, ChartJS or ReactJS are also valued);
+ REST APIs;
+ SQL and Non-SQL databases such as SQL Server, MySQL, Oracle, MongoDB;
+ Data streaming platforms such as Kafka, Docker, GIT;
+ data visualization tools like Grafana, PowerBi or Tableau;
+ Python or similar;
+ Prior experience with Machine Learning, Artificial Intelligence, or Business Intelligence is considered a plus.
* Creativity and analytical skills;
* Strong orientation towards teamwork;
* Advanced knowledge of English (spoken and written).


**Additional Information**

**Internship duration:** 12 months.


**Work #LikeABosch includes:**

Flexible work conditions | Hybrid work system | Medical office on site (general surgeon, psychology, physiotherapy, general clinic) | Training opportunities (p.e., technical training, foreign languages training) & certifications | Access to great discounts in partnerships and Bosch products | Sports and health related activities | Free parking lot | Canteen


